IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-QHITTER-QUANT.

DATA DIVISION.
01 CHANNELS-COUNT      PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 OUTLIER-RATIO-PCT   PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 OUTLIERS-COUNT      PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-QHITTER.
    IF CHANNELS-COUNT == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF OUTLIER-RATIO-PCT == 0
        MOVE 5 TO OUTLIER-RATIO-PCT.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE OUTLIERS-COUNT = (CHANNELS-COUNT * OUTLIER-RATIO-PCT) / 100.
    IF OUTLIERS-COUNT == 0
        MOVE 1 TO OUTLIERS-COUNT.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 OUTLIERS-COUNT.
    WEIGHT 30 CHANNELS-COUNT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
